 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "The conditional is formed with **бы** and the past of the verb: **я бы купил**, **ты бы пошла**, **мы бы поехали**. The past agrees in gender and number.",
      "**Бы** is an unstressed particle that is written separately and cannot begin a subordinate clause: **я бы купил** / **я купил бы**. Its position can change depending on which word is to be emphasised."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If I were...",
     "texto": [
      "With **если бы** you state a hypothesis: **Если бы у меня были деньги, я бы путешествовал** («If I had money, I would travel»). The condition uses the past; the result uses **бы** + past. **Богат** is the masculine short form of **богатый**.",
      "Do not confuse it with a real condition: **Если у меня есть деньги** means «if I have money» and is used without **бы**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
